# This file is not a second account.
# The shared store is ~/.config/smartschool/credentials.json
# (or $GROK_PLUGIN_DATA/credentials.json when that variable is set).
# The Claude plugin, Grok plugin, and MCP server all read that file.
# A filled-in config.env or repo .env is only copied in once when the
# shared file does not exist yet. Do not keep passwords in both places.
#
# SMARTSCHOOL_PROFILE selects one saved login (dering, dering:user, or user@dering).
# Process environment variables override one run. They are not a second file.
